# DEF-0058 (R-366). Every text file is checked out with LF on every machine,
# whatever core.autocrlf says. Git for Windows defaults to autocrlf=true, and a
# fresh checkout (the tester's worktree, a clone, a branch switch) then wrote
# the shell runner and the .mjs scripts with CRLF: bash refused
# scripts/run-sql-test.sh at its `set -o pipefail` line, and a script that opens
# with a shebang failed to import. The index has always held LF; this makes the
# working tree hold what the index and CI hold.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Pictures are never text.
*.png binary
